s`\n- **How:** Keep the pattern but move `startPolling()` call into a `useEffect` instead of the render body.\n\n#### 4. `infoViewContext` (error/success notification)\n- **Path:** `libs/helpers/src/context/AppInfoViewContext/`\n- **What to reuse:** `useInfoViewActionsContext()` → `fetchError()` / `showMessage()`\n- **How:** Show a user-facing message when polling reaches max retries (\"Job is taking longer than expected, please refresh manually\").\n\n#### 5. `AppRefreshIcon` + manual refresh button pattern\n- **Path:** `libs/icons` (`AppRefreshIcon`)\n- **What to reuse:** All 3 polling components already have a manual \"Refresh\" button. If polling stops after max retries, the user can still manually refresh.\n\n#### 6. `getUploadStatus` pattern (UploadData)\n- **Path:** `libs/smb/src/lib/gst/Gstr1/UploadData/index.tsx:53-90`\n- **What to reuse:** The `getDataApi('gst-returns/gstr1/upload-status/', ...)` call pattern.\n- **How:** Fix the `useEffect` cleanup to always clear the interval, and add a max retry counter.\n\n#### 7. `FileReturnGSTR1` / `CommonModules/FileReturns` — proceed-file flow\n- **Paths:**\n  - `libs/smb/src/lib/gst/Gstr1/FileReturnGSTR1/index.tsx` (GSTR1-specific)\n  - `libs/smb/src/lib/gst/CommonModules/FileReturns/index.tsx` (generic, config-driven)\n  - `libs/smb/src/lib/gst/Gstr6/FileReturnGSTR6/index.tsx`\n  - `libs/smb/src/lib/gst/Gstr9/FileReturnGSTR9/index.tsx`\n  - `libs/smb/src/lib/gst/Itc04/FileReturnITC04/index.tsx`\n  - `libs/smb/src/lib/tds/forms/forms/FileForm/index.tsx`\n- **What to reuse:** The `onSubmitFile`/`onSubmitFIle` function that calls `gst-returns/gstr/proceed-file/`.\n- **How:** If the backend returns a `job_id`, add polling to track job completion.\n\n#### 8. `useExpireTime` hook (countdown timer pattern)\n- **Path:** `libs/helpers/src/hooks/useExpireTime.tsx`\n- **What to reuse:** As a reference for implementing a max-duration timeout for polling.\n\n#### 9. `Gstr1/index.tsx` — the orchestrating page\n- **Path:** `apps/enterprise/src/app/GSTReturn/Gstr1/index.tsx`\n- **What to reuse:** Shows how `FileReturnGSTR1` and `UploadGSTR1Data` are rendered in tabs.\n- **How:** The tab-based rendering means both upload polling AND file-return polling can be active simultaneously.\n\n#### 10. Return configuration\n- **Path:** `apps/enterprise/src/app/GSTReturn/config/returnConfig.ts`\n- **What to reuse:** The `returnConfigs` array defines all return types and their steps. The filing step (`File Return`) is the last step for each return type.\n\n---\n\n### Summary of Recommended Fixes\n\n1. **Enhance `usePolling` hook** with `maxRetries` (default ~60 = 5 min at 5s intervals) and a `stopPolling` return function.\n2. **Move `startPolling()` calls into `useEffect`** in all 3 consumer components instead of calling in render body.\n3. **Fix `UploadGSTR1Data` cleanup** — always clear interval on unmount regardless of `uploadId`; move `timer` to a `useRef`.\n4. **Add timeout feedback** — show message to user when polling stops after max retries.\n\nError: Reached max turns (4)"
